# Lines the code page test (codepage.bat) must write to COM1 without
# DISPLAY.SYS (scripts/smoke-test): CON has no code page switching, so
# CON's query fails with invalid function (1), MODE's CP commands are not
# supported (SELECT is a device error), KEYB cannot learn CON's code page,
# and the font stays the VGA BIOS' own. CHCP changes only DOS's tables.
# The font lines are checked as in tests/codepage/ega/expect.

^GRDOS-TEST-BEGIN$
^== BOOT$
^CON CODEPAGE ERROR 1$
^FONT 9B (?!00 00 00 00 00 7C C[6E] )[0-9A-F]{2}( [0-9A-F]{2}){15}$
^FONT D5 00 00 00 00 00 1F 18 1F 18 18 18 18 18 18 18 18$
^Code page operation not supported on this device$
^== PREPARE$
^Code page operation not supported on this device$
^Code page operation not supported on this device$
^== SELECT$
^Device error during select$
^CON CODEPAGE ERROR 1$
^== KEYB$
^Current keyboard code: GR  code page: 437$
^Active code page not available from CON device$
^== CHCP$
^Active code page: 437$
^CON CODEPAGE ERROR 1$
^Current keyboard code: GR  code page: 437$
^Active code page not available from CON device$
^CON CODEPAGE ERROR 1$
^FONT 9B (?!00 00 00 00 00 7C C[6E] )[0-9A-F]{2}( [0-9A-F]{2}){15}$
^FONT D5 00 00 00 00 00 1F 18 1F 18 18 18 18 18 18 18 18$
^== MODE$
^CON CODEPAGE ERROR 1$

# SELECT and CHCP 865, SELECT 860, the two bad PREPAREs, the missing file
# (found before the device is asked), REFRESH
^== ERRORS$
^Device error during select$
^Invalid code page$
^Device error during select$
^Code page operation not supported on this device$
^Code page operation not supported on this device$
^Failure to access code page font file$
^Code page operation not supported on this device$
^CON CODEPAGE ERROR 1$
^FONT 9B (?!00 00 00 00 00 7C C[6E] )[0-9A-F]{2}( [0-9A-F]{2}){15}$
^FONT D5 00 00 00 00 00 1F 18 1F 18 18 18 18 18 18 18 18$
^GRDOS-TEST-END$
